---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="JobLens" description="Smart LinkedIn job filter. Flags Reposted, Applied, No Sponsor, Unpaid, and lets you skip companies & title keywords.">
  <main class="jl-page grid-page">
    <a href="/" class="back-link" data-i18n="nav.back">&larr; Back</a>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="jl-header">
      <img src="/images/joblens-icon.png" alt="JobLens icon" class="jl-logo" />
      <div>
        <div class="jl-title-row">
          <h1>JobLens</h1>
          <div class="jl-version-wrap">
            <button class="jl-version-btn" id="jl-changelog-toggle" aria-label="View changelog">v1.0</button>
            <div class="jl-changelog-backdrop" id="jl-changelog-backdrop" style="display:none"></div>
            <div class="jl-changelog-popup" id="jl-changelog-popup" style="display:none">
              <div class="jl-changelog-header">
                <span class="jl-changelog-title" data-i18n="joblens.changelogTitle">Changelog</span>
                <button class="jl-changelog-close" id="jl-changelog-close" aria-label="Close changelog">&times;</button>
              </div>
              <div id="jl-changelog-content"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="jl-feedback-wrap">
            <button class="jl-feedback-btn" id="jl-feedback-toggle" data-i18n="joblens.feedback" aria-label="Send feedback">Feedback</button>
            <div class="jl-feedback-backdrop" id="jl-feedback-backdrop" style="display:none"></div>
            <div class="jl-feedback-popup" id="jl-feedback-popup" style="display:none">
              <div class="jl-feedback-header">
                <span class="jl-feedback-title" data-i18n="joblens.feedbackTitle">Any Suggestion? Pls!!!</span>
                <button class="jl-feedback-close" id="jl-feedback-close" aria-label="Close feedback form">&times;</button>
              </div>
              <form id="jl-feedback-form">
                <textarea name="message" required rows="4" class="jl-feedback-textarea" id="jl-feedback-textarea" placeholder="Bugs, ideas, anything..."></textarea>
                <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
                <button type="submit" class="jl-feedback-submit" id="jl-feedback-submit" data-i18n="joblens.feedbackSend">Send</button>
              </form>
              <p class="jl-feedback-success" id="jl-feedback-success" style="display:none" data-i18n="joblens.feedbackSent">Thanks! Feedback sent.</p>
              <p class="jl-feedback-error" id="jl-feedback-error" style="display:none" data-i18n="joblens.feedbackError">Failed to send. Try again?</p>
            </div>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="jl-subtitle" data-i18n="joblens.subtitle">
          A Chrome extension that helps you focus on job applications worth your time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Inspiration -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.inspirationTitle">Inspiration</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.inspiration1">If you've job-hunted on LinkedIn, you know the drill: click a listing, "Reposted." Click another, "Reposted" again. Those roles have been up for weeks and the odds of hearing back are slim, but you can't tell until you've already clicked.</p>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.inspiration2">It doesn't stop there. Visa sponsorship? Unpaid? That info is buried in the full description, so you're opening every single listing just to rule it out. Do that dozens of times a day and most of your "job search" is really just triage.</p>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.inspiration3">The frustrating part is that LinkedIn is actually good at finding relevant jobs. Its recommendations surface roles you'd miss on your own, and its search understands queries like "Product Marketing Intern in the past 24 hours." The platform itself isn't the problem. The workflow is. That's why JobLens exists.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- What It Does -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.whatTitle">What It Does</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.whatDesc">LinkedIn search shows everything: reposted roles, jobs you already applied to, positions that don't sponsor visas. JobLens sits on the page and flags them automatically, so you only spend time on jobs that actually fit.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- What It Flags -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.flagsTitle">What It Flags</h2>
      <div class="jl-flags">
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:#D9797B">Reposted</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.reposted">Job has been reposted (card text + detail panel)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:#D9797B">Applied</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.applied">You already applied to this one</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:#D9797B">No Sponsor</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.noSponsor">Description says visa sponsorship not available</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:#D9797B">Unpaid</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.unpaid">Volunteer or unpaid position</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:#D9797B">Skipped Co.</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.skippedCo">Company you've blocked</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jl-flag">
          <span class="jl-flag-badge" style="background:#D9797B">Skipped Title</span>
          <span class="jl-flag-desc" data-i18n="joblens.flag.skippedTitle">Title contains a keyword you're avoiding</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- See It in Action -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.demoTitle">See It in Action</h2>
      <div class="jl-screenshots">
        <figure class="jl-screenshot-figure">
          <img src="/images/joblens-dim-off.png" alt="JobLens badges on LinkedIn job cards" class="jl-screenshot" />
          <figcaption data-i18n="joblens.cap.badges">Badges flag issues at a glance</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="jl-screenshot-figure">
          <img src="/images/joblens-dim-on.png" alt="JobLens dim mode fading flagged cards" class="jl-screenshot" />
          <figcaption data-i18n="joblens.cap.dim">Dim mode fades flagged cards</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Get Started -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.startTitle">Get Started</h2>
      <ol class="jl-steps">
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step1">Install from the <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/ainpeagpaoafcblhcebbakofagiocooa?utm_source=kunli_website" class="jl-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chrome Web Store</a></li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step2">Go to <strong>LinkedIn Jobs</strong> and search for roles</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step3">The JobLens panel appears on the left. Badges auto-detect <strong>Reposted</strong> and <strong>Applied</strong></li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step4">Click <strong>Scan Jobs</strong> to check descriptions for No Sponsor and Unpaid</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step5">Add companies or keywords to your <strong>skip lists</strong></li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.step6">Toggle <strong>Dim mode</strong> to fade flagged cards</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- Features -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.howTitle">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="jl-pipeline">
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.detect">Detect</span>
        </div>
        <span class="jl-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.badge">Badge</span>
        </div>
        <span class="jl-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="22 3 2 3 10 12.46 10 19 14 21 14 12.46 22 3"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.filter">Filter</span>
        </div>
        <span class="jl-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="jl-step">
          <span class="jl-step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="jl-step-label" data-i18n="joblens.pipe.focus">Focus</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.howDesc">Reads card text and job descriptions directly in the page. No external servers, no API calls. Everything runs in your browser.</p>

      <ul class="jl-features">
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.autoScan"><strong>Auto-Scan</strong>: clicks through every visible listing and checks the detail panel</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.skipLists"><strong>Skip lists</strong>: block companies or title keywords, supports batch paste</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.dimMode"><strong>Dim mode</strong>: fades flagged cards so clean listings stand out</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.persistence"><strong>Badge persistence</strong>: badges survive LinkedIn's DOM re-renders</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.draggable"><strong>Draggable panel</strong>: move it anywhere, click to collapse</li>
        <li data-i18n="joblens.feat.keyboard"><strong>Keyboard shortcut</strong>: <code>Ctrl+Shift+J</code> to toggle the panel</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Privacy -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2 data-i18n="joblens.privacyTitle">Privacy</h2>
      <p data-i18n="joblens.privacyDesc">JobLens runs entirely in your browser. No data is collected, transmitted, or stored externally. Your skip lists and preferences are saved locally on your device.</p>
      <a href="/job-lens/privacy" class="jl-link" style="font-size:var(--fs-xs)" data-i18n="joblens.privacyLink">Full privacy policy &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="jl-cta">
      <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/ainpeagpaoafcblhcebbakofagiocooa?utm_source=kunli_website" class="jl-store-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg class="jl-store-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><line x1="21.17" y1="8" x2="12" y2="8"/><line x1="3.95" y1="6.06" x2="8.54" y2="14"/><line x1="10.88" y1="21.94" x2="15.46" y2="14"/></svg>
        <span>Chrome Web Store</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="jl-haas-credit" data-i18n="joblens.haasCredit">Built during my MBA at Berkeley Haas, 2024–2026.</p>

    <!-- Lightbox -->
    <dialog class="jl-lightbox" id="jl-lightbox">
      <img id="jl-lightbox-img" alt="" />
    </dialog>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    // --- Lightbox ---
    const dialog = document.getElementById('jl-lightbox') as HTMLDialogElement | null;
    const lbImg = document.getElementById('jl-lightbox-img') as HTMLImageElement | null;
    if (dialog && lbImg) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.jl-screenshot').forEach(img => {
        img.addEventListener('click', () => {
          lbImg.src = (img as HTMLImageElement).src;
          lbImg.alt = (img as HTMLImageElement).alt;
          dialog.showModal();
        });
      });
      dialog.addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
    }

    // --- CTA tracking ---
    document.querySelector('.jl-store-link')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      (window as any).dataLayer?.push({ event: 'joblens_cta_click' });
    });

    // --- Changelog ---
    const JL_CHANGELOG = [
      { version: 'v1.0',
        why: {
          en: 'LinkedIn search shows everything: reposted, applied, no-sponsor. Why not flag them automatically?',
          zh: 'LinkedIn 搜索什么都显示：已转发、已申请、不赞助签证。为什么不自动标记呢？',
        },
        changes: {
          en: [
            'Auto-scan LinkedIn job cards and flag Reposted, Applied, No Sponsor, Unpaid',
            'Skip lists for companies and title keywords, with batch import/export',
            'Draggable frosted-glass panel with dim mode for filtered cards',
          ],
          zh: [
            '自动扫描 LinkedIn 职位卡片，标记 Reposted、Applied、No Sponsor、Unpaid',
            '公司和职位关键词屏蔽列表，支持批量导入导出',
            '可拖动的毛玻璃面板，淡化模式让已标记卡片变暗',
          ],
        }},
    ];

    const clToggle = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-toggle');
    const clPopup = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-popup');
    const clBackdrop = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-backdrop');
    const clClose = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-close');
    const clContent = document.getElementById('jl-changelog-content');

    function renderChangelog() {
      if (!clContent) return;
      const lang = (document.documentElement.dataset.lang as 'en' | 'zh') || 'en';
      clContent.innerHTML = JL_CHANGELOG.map(r => `
        <div class="jl-changelog-release">
          <div class="jl-changelog-version">${r.version}</div>
          <p class="jl-changelog-why">${r.why[lang]}</p>
          <ul class="jl-changelog-list">
            ${r.changes[lang].map(c => `<li>${c}</li>`).join('')}
          </ul>
        </div>
      `).join('');
    }
    renderChangelog();
    document.addEventListener('lang-change', renderChangelog);

    function openChangelog() {
      if (clPopup) clPopup.style.display = '';
      if (clBackdrop) clBackdrop.style.display = '';
    }
    function closeChangelog() {
      if (clPopup) clPopup.style.display = 'none';
      if (clBackdrop) clBackdrop.style.display = 'none';
    }

    clToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (clPopup?.style.display === 'none') openChangelog();
      else closeChangelog();
    });
    clBackdrop?.addEventListener('click', closeChangelog);
    clClose?.addEventListener('click', closeChangelog);

    // --- Feedback ---
    const toggle = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-toggle');
    const popup = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-popup');
    const backdrop = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-backdrop');
    const closeBtn = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-close');
    const form = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
    const submitBtn = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-submit');
    const successMsg = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-success');
    const errorMsg = document.getElementById('jl-feedback-error');

    function openFeedback() {
      if (!popup || !backdrop) return;
      popup.style.display = '';
      backdrop.style.display = '';
      if (successMsg) successMsg.style.display = 'none';
      if (errorMsg) errorMsg.style.display = 'none';
      if (form) form.style.display = '';
    }

    function closeFeedback() {
      if (popup) popup.style.display = 'none';
      if (backdrop) backdrop.style.display = 'none';
    }

    toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (popup?.style.display === 'none') openFeedback();
      else closeFeedback();
    });
    backdrop?.addEventListener('click', closeFeedback);
    closeBtn?.addEventListener('click', closeFeedback);

    form?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (!submitBtn || !form) return;
      submitBtn.setAttribute('disabled', '');
      submitBtn.textContent = '...';
      if (errorMsg) errorMsg.style.display = 'none';

      try {
        const res = await fetch('https://formspree.io/f/xreykpga', {
          method: 'POST',
          body: new FormData(form),
          headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
        });
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error();
        form.style.display = 'none';
        if (successMsg) successMsg.style.display = '';
      } catch {
        if (errorMsg) errorMsg.style.display = '';
      } finally {
        submitBtn.removeAttribute('disabled');
        // Text restored by applyTranslations via data-i18n
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .jl-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .jl-logo {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .jl-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .jl-header h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .jl-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .section h3 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .section p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* Flag badges */
  .jl-flags {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .jl-flag {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .jl-flag-badge {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.15em 0.6em;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #fff;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 5.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .jl-flag-desc {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  /* Screenshots */
  .jl-screenshots {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .jl-screenshots {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .jl-screenshot-figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .jl-screenshot {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    cursor: zoom-in;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .jl-screenshot:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .jl-screenshot-figure figcaption {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* Pipeline */
  .jl-pipeline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .jl-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .jl-step-icon {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .jl-step-icon svg {
    width: 1.4rem;
    height: 1.4rem;
  }

  .jl-step-label {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .jl-arrow {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  /* Steps */
  .jl-steps {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .jl-steps li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .jl-steps li::marker {
    color: var(--color-rose);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .jl-steps code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .jl-steps strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .jl-link {
    color: var(--color-rose);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .jl-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Features list */
  .jl-features {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .jl-features li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .jl-features li::marker {
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .jl-features strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .jl-features code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .jl-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .jl-store-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--color-rose);
    padding: 0.5em 1.2em;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .jl-store-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .jl-store-icon {
    width: 1.2em;
    height: 1.2em;
  }

  /* Haas credit */
  .jl-haas-credit {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  /* Lightbox */
  .jl-lightbox {
    border: none;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    max-width: 90vw;
    max-height: 90vh;
    cursor: zoom-out;
  }

  .jl-lightbox::backdrop {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
  }

  .jl-lightbox img {
    max-width: 90vw;
    max-height: 90vh;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  /* Version badge & changelog */
  .jl-version-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .jl-version-btn {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
